From: CoreELEC
Subject: [PATCH] libCEC: retain callback and response owners through close

Drain callback and producer workers before resetting responses or freeing their
processor. Restart callbacks on Open, discard old connection events, and retain
queued menu results and borrowed responses across timeout/reset. Keep native
transport alive until completed retirement; preserve close/reopen behavior.

